"The template changed since this was arranged: %s is gone and is left out."
msgstr ""
"Het sjabloon is gewijzigd sinds deze indeling. Niet meer aanwezig en daarom "
"weggelaten: %s."

#: src/Admin/GroupsStrings.php:31
msgid ""
"The template has fields this arrangement does not name yet: they show at the "
