#. translators: Reason recorded on the refund of an order item, shown to the merchant in the order.
#: src/Approval/ProofDenial.php:109
msgid "Design proof rejected by the customer"
msgstr "Drukproef van het ontwerp afgewezen door de klant"

#. translators: %s: product name of the order line.
#: src/Approval/ProofDenial.php:120
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: the customer did not approve the design of \"%s\" by the deadline, "
"so it was rejected and will not be printed. Refund or cancel the item."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: de klant heeft het ontwerp van “%s” niet binnen de termijn "
"goedgekeurd, dus het is afgewezen en wordt niet gedrukt. Betaal het artikel "
"terug of annuleer het."

#. translators: %s: product name of the order line.
#: src/Approval/ProofDenial.php:122
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: the customer rejected the proof of \"%s\", so it will not be "
"printed. Refund or cancel the item."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: de klant heeft de drukproef van “%s” afgewezen, dus het wordt niet "
"gedrukt. Betaal het artikel terug of annuleer het."

#. translators: Option in the proof settings: what happens to a design the customer never answers. The merchant reads it.
#: src/Approval/ProofOutcome.php:66
msgid "Approve the design as shown"
msgstr "Het ontwerp goedkeuren zoals getoond"

#. translators: Option in the proof settings: what happens to a design the customer never answers. The merchant reads it.
#: src/Approval/ProofOutcome.php:68
msgid "Deny the design"
msgstr "Het ontwerp afwijzen"

#. translators: Option in the proof settings: what happens to an order item whose design is denied. The merchant reads it.
#: src/Approval/ProofOutcome.php:85
msgid "Refund and cancel the item"
msgstr "Het artikel terugbetalen en annuleren"

#. translators: Option in the proof settings: what happens to an order item whose design is denied. The merchant reads it.
#: src/Approval/ProofOutcome.php:87
msgid "Cancel the item"
msgstr "Het artikel annuleren"

#. translators: Option in the proof settings: what happens to an order item whose design is denied. The merchant reads it.
#: src/Approval/ProofOutcome.php:89
msgid "Mark the item as needing attention"
msgstr "Het artikel markeren als ‘Vraagt aandacht’"

#. translators: %s: product name of the order line.
#: src/Approval/ProofRequest.php:91
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: the proof of \"%s\" was not sent. Its design was changed in "
"Pixonaut after it was bought."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: de drukproef van “%s” is niet verstuurd. Het ontwerp is in "
"Pixonaut gewijzigd nadat het was gekocht."

#. translators: %s: product name of the order line.
#: src/Approval/ProofRequest.php:105
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: the proof of \"%s\" was not sent. Its design is no longer waiting "
"for approval in Pixonaut."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: de drukproef van “%s” is niet verstuurd. Het ontwerp wacht in "
"Pixonaut niet meer op goedkeuring."

#. translators: 1: product name of the order line, 2: error code Pixonaut answered.
#: src/Approval/ProofRequest.php:131
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: the proof of \"%1$s\" was not sent. Pixonaut refused its proof "
"page: %2$s."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: de drukproef van “%1$s” is niet verstuurd. Pixonaut weigerde de "
"pagina met de drukproef: %2$s."

#. translators: %s: product name of the order line.
#: src/Approval/ProofRequest.php:143
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: \"%s\" is awaiting design approval. The customer was sent a proof "
"to approve."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: “%s” wacht op goedkeuring van het ontwerp. De klant heeft een "
"drukproef ontvangen om goed te keuren."

#. translators: %s: product name of the order line.
#: src/Approval/ProofTimers.php:230
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: the proof deadline of \"%s\" could not be scheduled, so the store "
"will not decide it on its own. The proof stays open for the customer; "
"approve or cancel the item when they do not answer."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: de termijn voor de drukproef van “%s” kon niet worden ingepland, "
"dus de winkel neemt er niet zelf een besluit over. De drukproef blijft "
"openstaan voor de klant; keur het artikel goed of annuleer het als de klant "
"niet reageert."

#. translators: Option in the approval setting, shown to the merchant on the settings page and the product page.
#: src/ApprovalMode.php:58
msgid "Adding to the cart approves the design"
msgstr "Toevoegen aan de winkelwagen keurt het ontwerp goed"

#. translators: Option in the approval setting, shown to the merchant; the quoted text is the checkbox label the shopper sees.
#: src/ApprovalMode.php:60
msgid "Customer ticks \"I approve the preview\""
msgstr "Klant vinkt “Ik keur het voorbeeld goed” aan"

#. translators: Option in the approval setting, shown to the merchant: the shopper approves a proof sent by email once the order is paid.
#: src/ApprovalMode.php:62
msgid "Proof by email after payment"
msgstr "Drukproef per e-mail na betaling"

#. translators: 1: product name, 2: Pixonaut's refusal code
#: src/Cart/AddToCart.php:820
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Customers cannot add \"%1$s\" to the cart: Pixonaut will not route its "
"designs to a printshop (%2$s). Check the printshop of the product's blank in "
"the Pixonaut studio."
msgstr ""
"Klanten kunnen “%1$s” niet aan de winkelwagen toevoegen: Pixonaut stuurt de "
"ontwerpen niet door naar een drukkerij (%2$s). Controleer de drukkerij van "
"het blanco product in de Pixonaut-studio."

#. translators: 1: link to the Pixonaut studio, 2: link to the troubleshooting guide.
#: src/Cart/CommitFailures.php:167
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Customers cannot add personalised products to the cart: Pixonaut suspended "
"the workspace, so it saves no designs. Check the workspace's plan and "
"billing in the <a href=\"%1$s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener "
"noreferrer\">Pixonaut studio</a>. <a href=\"%2$s\" target=\"_blank\" "
"rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Troubleshooting</a>"
msgstr ""
"Klanten kunnen geen gepersonaliseerde producten aan de winkelwagen "
"toevoegen: Pixonaut heeft de werkruimte opgeschort en slaat dus geen "
"ontwerpen op. Controleer het abonnement en de facturering van de werkruimte "
"in de <a href=\"%1$s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener "
"noreferrer\">Pixonaut-studio</a>. <a href=\"%2$s\" target=\"_blank\" "
"rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Problemen oplossen</a>"

#. translators: 1: link to the Pixonaut studio, 2: link to the troubleshooting guide.
#: src/Cart/CommitFailures.php:169
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Customers cannot add personalised products to the cart: Pixonaut keeps "
"refusing or not answering when the store saves their designs. Check the "
"workspace in the <a href=\"%1$s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener "
"noreferrer\">Pixonaut studio</a>, and the pixonaut-api log under WooCommerce "
"> Status > Logs. <a href=\"%2$s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener "
"noreferrer\">Troubleshooting</a>"
msgstr ""
"Klanten kunnen geen gepersonaliseerde producten aan de winkelwagen "
"toevoegen: Pixonaut weigert steeds of reageert niet wanneer de winkel hun "
"ontwerpen opslaat. Controleer de werkruimte in de <a href=\"%1$s\" "
"target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Pixonaut-studio</a> en het log "
"pixonaut-api onder WooCommerce > Status > Logs. <a href=\"%2$s\" "
"target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Problemen oplossen</a>"

#. translators: Option of the setting for which view of the product a personalised item's picture shows in the cart and orders. The merchant reads it.
#: src/Cart/PictureView.php:44
msgid "The view the customer previewed"
msgstr "Het aanzicht van het voorbeeld dat de klant zag"

#. translators: Option of the setting for which view of the product a personalised item's picture shows in the cart and orders. The merchant reads it.
#: src/Cart/PictureView.php:46
msgid "The placement’s first view"
msgstr "Het eerste aanzicht van de drukpositie"

#. translators: 1: a custom product attribute's name; 2: a global product attribute's taxonomy, e.g. pa_size.
#: src/Catalogue/AttributeMove.php:117
#, php-format
msgid "The product has both %1$s and %2$s. Remove one, then move it."
msgstr ""
"Het product heeft zowel %1$s als %2$s. Verwijder er een en verplaats het "
"product dan."

#. translators: 1: how many variations the product has; 2: the most a move can write.
#: src/Catalogue/AttributeMove.php:125
#, php-format
msgid "The product has %1$d variations, and a move can write at most %2$d."
msgstr ""
"Het product heeft %1$d variaties, en een verplaatsing kan er hooguit %2$d "
"schrijven."

#. translators: 1: a product variation's id; 2: the value it holds of a custom product attribute; 3: the attribute's name.
#: src/Catalogue/AttributeMove.php:164
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Variation %1$d holds %2$s, which %3$s does not offer. Correct the variation, "
"then move it."
msgstr ""
"Variatie %1$d heeft de waarde %2$s, die %3$s niet biedt. Corrigeer de "
"variatie en verplaats het product dan."

#: src/Catalogue/AttributeMove.php:271
msgid ""
"The product changed meanwhile and no longer has this attribute. Nothing was "
"changed."
msgstr ""
"Het product is tussentijds gewijzigd en heeft dit attribuut niet meer. Er is "
"niets gewijzigd."

#: src/Catalogue/AttributeMove.php:407
msgid "The product's attribute could not be saved. Nothing was changed."
msgstr ""
"Het attribuut van het product kon niet worden opgeslagen. Er is niets "
"gewijzigd."

#. translators: %d: a product variation's id.
#: src/Catalogue/AttributeMove.php:418
#, php-format
msgid "Variation %d could not be saved. Nothing was changed."
msgstr "Variatie %d kon niet worden opgeslagen. Er is niets gewijzigd."

#. translators: 1, 2: two values of a custom product attribute.
#: src/Catalogue/AttributeMove.php:572
#, php-format
msgid ""
"%1$s and %2$s have the same slug, so the move could not tell which a "
"variation holds. Rename one, then move it."
msgstr ""
"%1$s en %2$s hebben dezelfde slug, dus de verplaatsing kon niet zien welke "
"een variatie heeft. Hernoem er een en verplaats het product dan."

#. translators: 1: a global product attribute's taxonomy, e.g. pa_size; 2: values of a custom product attribute, separated by commas.
#: src/Catalogue/AttributeMove.php:594
#, php-format
msgid ""
"%1$s has no term for: %2$s. Create the terms or name them in term_map, then "
"move it."
msgstr ""
"%1$s heeft geen term voor: %2$s. Maak de termen aan of noem ze in term_map "
"en verplaats het product dan."

#. translators: %s: a global product attribute's taxonomy, e.g. pa_size.
#: src/Catalogue/AttributeMove.php:602
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Two of the product's values would become one term of %s, and customers could "
"no longer tell its variations apart."
msgstr ""
"Twee waarden van het product zouden één term van %s worden, en klanten "
"konden de variaties niet meer uit elkaar houden."

#. translators: %d: a product or variation's id.
#: src/Catalogue/AttributeMove.php:633
#, php-format
msgid ""
"%d is matched to its blank's variant by the attribute's words, which the "
"move would change, so it would stop selling. Pick its variant with set-"
"product-setup, then move it."
msgstr ""
"%d is via de woorden van het attribuut gekoppeld aan de variant van zijn "
"blanco product, die de verplaatsing zou wijzigen, waardoor het niet meer "
"verkocht zou worden. Kies de variant met set-product-setup en verplaats het "
"product dan."

#: src/Catalogue/AttributeMove.php:675
msgid ""
"The product's Pixonaut setup changed meanwhile. Nothing was changed; try "
"again."
msgstr ""
"De Pixonaut-instellingen van het product zijn tussentijds gewijzigd. Er is "
"niets gewijzigd; probeer het opnieuw."

#. translators: Option of the Canvas shape dropdown: the designer's canvas keeps the template's own proportions at every print size. Admin product page.
#: src/Catalogue/CanvasRatio.php:86
msgid "Always the template’s shape"
msgstr "Altijd de vorm van het sjabloon"

#. translators: Option of the Canvas shape dropdown: the designer's canvas takes the proportions of the print size the customer chose. Admin product page.
#: src/Catalogue/CanvasRatio.php:88
msgid "Always the chosen print size’s shape"
msgstr "Altijd de vorm van het gekozen drukformaat"

#: src/Catalogue/InvalidReason.php:115
msgid "Choose a template."
msgstr "Kies een sjabloon."

#: src/Catalogue/InvalidReason.php:117
msgid "Choose where on the blank the design is printed."
msgstr "Kies waar op het blanco product het ontwerp wordt gedrukt."

#: src/Catalogue/InvalidReason.php:119
msgid "The blank no longer exists in Pixonaut."
msgstr "Het blanco product bestaat niet meer in Pixonaut."

#: src/Catalogue/InvalidReason.php:121
msgid ""
"The blank is deleted in Pixonaut. Restore it in the Pixonaut studio, or "
"choose another blank."
msgstr ""
"Het blanco product is verwijderd in Pixonaut. Zet het terug in de Pixonaut-"
"studio of kies een ander blanco product."

#: src/Catalogue/InvalidReason.php:123
msgid ""
"The blank no longer has this placement, or Pixonaut cannot size a print for "
"it."
msgstr ""
"Het blanco product heeft deze drukpositie niet meer, of Pixonaut kan er geen "
"drukformaat voor bepalen."

#: src/Catalogue/InvalidReason.php:125
msgid "The template no longer exists in Pixonaut."
msgstr "Het sjabloon bestaat niet meer in Pixonaut."

#: src/Catalogue/InvalidReason.php:127
msgid ""
"The template is paused or deleted in Pixonaut. Make it live again, or choose "
"another template."
msgstr ""
"Het sjabloon is gepauzeerd of verwijderd in Pixonaut. Zet het weer live of "
"kies een ander sjabloon."

#. translators: %d: most sides a product can have.
#: src/Catalogue/InvalidReason.php:131
#, php-format
msgid "A product has at most %d sides."
msgstr "Een product heeft maximaal %d zijden."

#: src/Catalogue/InvalidReason.php:135
msgid "Two sides use the same placement. Each placement can be one side only."
msgstr ""
"Twee zijden gebruiken dezelfde drukpositie. Elke drukpositie kan maar één "
"zijde zijn."

#: src/Catalogue/InvalidReason.php:137
msgid "Two sides have the same key. Give each side its own."
msgstr ""
"Twee zijden hebben dezelfde sleutel. Geef elke zijde een eigen sleutel."

#: src/Catalogue/InvalidReason.php:139
msgid ""
"A custom print size needs a width and height in millimetres, both above zero."
msgstr ""
"Een aangepast drukformaat heeft een breedte en hoogte in millimeters nodig, "
"beide groter dan nul."

#. translators: %d: most print sizes one side can offer.
#: src/Catalogue/InvalidReason.php:143
#, php-format
msgid "A side offers at most %d print sizes."
msgstr "Een zijde biedt maximaal %d drukformaten."

#: src/Catalogue/InvalidReason.php:147
msgid ""
"Add a print size in millimetres. Without a blank there is no placement to "
"take one from."
msgstr ""
"Voeg een drukformaat in millimeters toe. Zonder blanco product is er geen "
"drukpositie om er een van over te nemen."

#: src/Catalogue/InvalidReason.php:149
msgid "The print size is larger than the placement can print."
msgstr "Het drukformaat is groter dan de drukpositie kan drukken."

#: src/Catalogue/InvalidReason.php:151
msgid "The print size does not match the template's aspect ratio."
msgstr "Het drukformaat past niet bij de beeldverhouding van het sjabloon."

#: src/Catalogue/InvalidReason.php:153
msgid ""
"Pixonaut could not check the configuration. Check the connection, then "
"update the product again."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut kon de configuratie niet controleren. Controleer de koppeling en "
"werk het product daarna opnieuw bij."

#: src/Catalogue/InvalidReason.php:155
msgid ""
"Pixonaut would not make the design of a standing side. Check the side's "
"template, placement and print size, then update the product again."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut weigerde het ontwerp van een vaste zijde te maken. Controleer het "
"sjabloon, de drukpositie en het drukformaat van de zijde en werk het product "
"daarna opnieuw bij."

#: src/Catalogue/InvalidReason.php:157
msgid ""
"Pixonaut would not make the design of a standing side: the store may not "
"create and approve designs. Check the connection's permissions in the "
"Pixonaut studio, then update the product again."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut weigerde het ontwerp van een vaste zijde te maken: de winkel mag "
"geen ontwerpen aanmaken en goedkeuren. Controleer de rechten van de "
"koppeling in de Pixonaut-studio en werk het product daarna opnieuw bij."

#: src/Catalogue/InvalidReason.php:159
msgid ""
"The template of a standing side does not fit the placement at any of the "
"blank's sizes, so none of them can be printed. Choose a template that fits."
msgstr ""
"Het sjabloon van een vaste zijde past in geen enkele maat van het blanco "
"product op de drukpositie, dus geen ervan kan worden gedrukt. Kies een "
"sjabloon dat past."

#: src/Catalogue/InvalidReason.php:161
msgid "Choose a blank, or a printshop that prints without one."
msgstr ""
"Kies een blanco product, of een drukkerij die zonder blanco product drukt."

#: src/Catalogue/InvalidReason.php:163
msgid ""
"The configuration was saved by a newer version of Pixonaut for WooCommerce. "
"Update the plugin."
msgstr ""
"De configuratie is opgeslagen door een nieuwere versie van Pixonaut for "
"WooCommerce. Werk de plugin bij."

#: src/Catalogue/InvalidReason.php:165
msgid "Pixonaut cannot print this configuration."
msgstr "Pixonaut kan deze configuratie niet drukken."

#. translators: %l: the sizes, e.g. "XL and 3XL". Beside a template in the template search of the admin product page: the template cannot be printed at these sizes of the blank.
#: src/Catalogue/MisfitSizes.php:88
msgid "Cannot print at %l"
msgstr "Niet te drukken in %l"

#. translators: %l: the sizes, e.g. "XL and 3XL". Warning on a side of the admin product page.
#: src/Catalogue/MisfitSizes.php:104
msgid ""
"This template does not fit the placement at %l: it cannot be printed at "
"those sizes. Choose a template that fits every size, or stop selling those "
"sizes."
msgstr ""
"Dit sjabloon past in %l niet op de drukpositie: het kan in die maten niet "
"worden gedrukt. Kies een sjabloon dat in elke maat past, of verkoop die "
"maten niet meer."

#. translators: 1: width, 2: height, both in millimetres.
#: src/Catalogue/PrintSize.php:74
#, php-format
msgid "%1$s × %2$s mm"
msgstr "%1$s × %2$s mm"

#. translators: %s: link to the Pixonaut settings.
#: src/Connection/Connection.php:444
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Site URL changed: this site is not the one that connected to Pixonaut, so "
"Pixonaut is paused here and nothing is sent for the site it was copied from. "
"Personalised products and orders are paused until you <a href=\"%s\">connect "
"this site</a>. For a staging site, pick Sandbox."
msgstr ""
"Site-URL gewijzigd: deze site is niet de site die aan Pixonaut is gekoppeld, "
"dus Pixonaut is hier gepauzeerd en er wordt niets verstuurd namens de site "
"waarvan deze is gekopieerd. Gepersonaliseerde producten en bestellingen zijn "
"gepauzeerd tot u <a href=\"%s\">deze site koppelt</a>. Kies Sandbox voor een "
"staging-site."

#. translators: %s: link to the Pixonaut settings.
#: src/Connection/Connection.php:446
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut no longer accepts this store's key: the store was disconnected in "
"Pixonaut, or its key was revoked. Personalised products and orders are "
"paused until you <a href=\"%s\">connect the store again</a>."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut accepteert de sleutel van deze winkel niet meer: de winkel is in "
"Pixonaut ontkoppeld of de sleutel is ingetrokken. Gepersonaliseerde "
"producten en bestellingen zijn gepauzeerd tot u <a href=\"%s\">de winkel "
"opnieuw koppelt</a>."

#. translators: %s: plugin version, e.g. 1.2.0.
#: src/DeprecatedHooks.php:119
#, php-format
msgid "Deprecated in Pixonaut for WooCommerce %s."
msgstr "Verouderd sinds Pixonaut for WooCommerce %s."

#. translators: Option in the designer language setting, shown to the merchant: use the default language set in the Pixonaut workspace.
#: src/DesignerLanguage.php:110
msgid "Pixonaut workspace default"
msgstr "Standaardtaal van de Pixonaut-werkruimte"

#. translators: Option in the designer language setting, shown to the merchant. %s: the workspace's default language, named in that language, e.g. Deutsch.
#: src/DesignerLanguage.php:112
#, php-format
msgid "Pixonaut workspace default (%s)"
msgstr "Standaardtaal van de Pixonaut-werkruimte (%s)"

#. translators: Option in the designer language setting, shown to the merchant: use the site's language.
#: src/DesignerLanguage.php:114
msgid "Follow the site"
msgstr "Taal van de site volgen"

#. translators: Name of the email to the customer with a link to change their design, shown in WooCommerce > Settings > Emails.
#: src/Emails/ChangesLinkEmail.php:39
msgctxt "name of the edit your design email in WooCommerce email settings"
msgid "Edit your design"
msgstr "Uw ontwerp bewerken"

#: src/Emails/ChangesLinkEmail.php:40
msgid ""
"Sent to the customer when they asked for changes to the proof of their "
"design, with a link that opens the design again for the changes."
msgstr ""
"Wordt naar de klant gestuurd wanneer die om wijzigingen in de drukproef van "
"het ontwerp heeft gevraagd, met een link die het ontwerp opnieuw opent om "
"het aan te passen."

#. translators: Default subject of the email to the customer. {order_number}, {site_title} and similar in braces are filled in by WooCommerce; keep them as written.
#: src/Emails/ChangesLinkEmail.php:61
msgid "Edit your design for order {order_number}"
msgstr "Bewerk uw ontwerp voor bestelling {order_number}"

#. translators: Heading at the top of the email to the customer with a link to change their design.
#: src/Emails/ChangesLinkEmail.php:69
msgctxt "heading of the email with a link to edit the design"
msgid "Edit your design"
msgstr "Bewerk uw ontwerp"

#. translators: Name of an email to the merchant, shown in WooCommerce > Settings > Emails.
#: src/Emails/ChangesRequestedEmail.php:41
msgid "Pixonaut design changes requested"
msgstr "Wijzigingen in Pixonaut-ontwerp gevraagd"

#: src/Emails/ChangesRequestedEmail.php:42
msgid ""
"Sent to the store when a customer asked for changes to the proof of their "
"design, with what they asked."
msgstr ""
"Wordt naar de winkel gestuurd wanneer een klant om wijzigingen in de "
"drukproef van het ontwerp heeft gevraagd, met wat de klant vroeg."

#. translators: Default subject of the email to the merchant. {order_number}, {site_title} and similar in braces are filled in by WooCommerce; keep them as written.
#: src/Emails/ChangesRequestedEmail.php:56
msgid "[{site_title}]: Changes requested for order #{order_number}"
msgstr "[{site_title}]: Wijzigingen gevraagd voor bestelling #{order_number}"

#. translators: Default heading at the top of the email to the merchant. Text in braces is filled in by WooCommerce; keep it as written.
#: src/Emails/ChangesRequestedEmail.php:61
msgid "Changes requested for order #{order_number}"
msgstr "Wijzigingen gevraagd voor bestelling #{order_number}"

#. translators: Name of an email to the merchant, shown in WooCommerce > Settings > Emails.
#: src/Emails/DeadlinePassedEmail.php:43
msgid "Pixonaut proof deadline passed"
msgstr "Termijn Pixonaut-drukproef verstreken"

#: src/Emails/DeadlinePassedEmail.php:44
msgid ""
"Sent to the store when a customer did not answer the proof of their design "
"by the deadline, with what happened to the item."
msgstr ""
"Wordt naar de winkel gestuurd wanneer een klant de drukproef van het ontwerp "
"niet binnen de termijn heeft beantwoord, met wat er met het artikel is "
"gebeurd."

#. translators: Default subject of the email to the merchant. {order_number}, {site_title} and similar in braces are filled in by WooCommerce; keep them as written.
#: src/Emails/DeadlinePassedEmail.php:58
msgid "[{site_title}]: Proof deadline passed for order #{order_number}"
msgstr ""
"[{site_title}]: Termijn drukproef verstreken voor bestelling #{order_number}"

#. translators: Default heading at the top of the email to the merchant. Text in braces is filled in by WooCommerce; keep it as written.
#: src/Emails/DeadlinePassedEmail.php:63
msgid "Proof deadline passed for order #{order_number}"
msgstr "Termijn drukproef verstreken voor bestelling #{order_number}"

#. translators: %s: why, as the store explains the item's attention reason.
#: src/Emails/DeadlinePassedEmail.php:98
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The store could not decide its proof, so the item needs your attention. %s"
msgstr ""
"De winkel kon geen besluit nemen over de drukproef, dus het artikel vraagt "
