"Pixonaut antwoordde als laatste “%3$s”. Controleer de bestelling in Pixonaut "
"en probeer het daarna opnieuw."

#. translators: 1: product name of the order line, 2: the error code Pixonaut answered.
#: src/Fulfilment/FulfilmentJobs.php:316
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: \"%1$s\" was not sent to the printshop. Pixonaut answered "
"\"%2$s\", and the store could not schedule another attempt. Retry the item."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: “%1$s” is niet naar de drukkerij gestuurd. Pixonaut antwoordde "
"“%2$s” en de winkel kon geen nieuwe poging inplannen. Probeer het artikel "
"opnieuw."

#. translators: 1: product name of the order line, 2: the error code Pixonaut answered.
#: src/Fulfilment/FulfilmentJobs.php:346
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: \"%1$s\" needs attention. The Pixonaut sandbox no longer knows its "
"design, print or order (\"%2$s\"); this happens when the sandbox's data was "
"reset. Place the item again."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: “%1$s” vraagt aandacht. De Pixonaut-sandbox kent het ontwerp, de "
"druk of de bestelling niet meer (“%2$s”); dit gebeurt wanneer de gegevens "
"van de sandbox zijn gewist. Plaats het artikel opnieuw."

#. translators: 1: product name of the order line, 2: the error code Pixonaut answered, 3: the Pixonaut order the design already has, 4: what the merchant can do.
#: src/Fulfilment/FulfilmentJobs.php:355
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: \"%1$s\" needs attention. Pixonaut refused it with \"%2$s\": its "
"design already has the Pixonaut order %3$s. %4$s"
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: “%1$s” vraagt aandacht. Pixonaut weigerde het met “%2$s”: het "
"ontwerp heeft al de Pixonaut-bestelling %3$s. %4$s"

#. translators: 1: product name of the order line, 2: the error code Pixonaut answered, 3: what the merchant can do.
#: src/Fulfilment/FulfilmentJobs.php:364
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: \"%1$s\" needs attention. Pixonaut refused it with \"%2$s\". %3$s"
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: “%1$s” vraagt aandacht. Pixonaut weigerde het met “%2$s”. %3$s"

#. translators: 1: product name of the order line, 2: the order's status in Pixonaut.
#: src/Fulfilment/LineActions.php:201
#, php-format
msgid "Pixonaut: the printshop order for \"%1$s\" is now \"%2$s\" in Pixonaut."
msgstr "Pixonaut: de drukopdracht voor “%1$s” is nu “%2$s” in Pixonaut."

#. translators: %s: product name of the order line.
#: src/Fulfilment/LineActions.php:495
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: \"%s\" could not be sent again: the store could not schedule it. "
"Retry the item."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: “%s” kon niet opnieuw worden verstuurd: de winkel kon het niet "
"inplannen. Probeer het artikel opnieuw."

#. translators: %s: product name of the order line.
#: src/Fulfilment/LineActions.php:505
#, php-format
msgid "Pixonaut: \"%s\" will be sent to the printshop again."
msgstr "Pixonaut: “%s” wordt opnieuw naar de drukkerij gestuurd."

#. translators: 1: product name of the order line, 2: the new Pixonaut order id.
#: src/Fulfilment/LineActions.php:596 src/Fulfilment/OrderSubmitted.php:177
#, php-format
msgid "Pixonaut: \"%1$s\" was sent to the printshop again, as order %2$s."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: “%1$s” is opnieuw naar de drukkerij gestuurd, als bestelling %2$s."

#. translators: 1: product name of the order line, 2: the new Pixonaut order id, 3: its status.
#: src/Fulfilment/LineActions.php:608
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: \"%1$s\" was sent to the printshop again, as order %2$s, which is "
"\"%3$s\"."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: “%1$s” is opnieuw naar de drukkerij gestuurd, als bestelling %2$s, "
"met de status “%3$s”."

#. translators: 1: product name of the order line, 2: what the merchant learned from the printshop.
#: src/Fulfilment/LineActions.php:638
#, php-format
msgid "Pixonaut: the printshop has the order for \"%1$s\". %2$s"
msgstr "Pixonaut: de drukkerij heeft de bestelling voor “%1$s”. %2$s"

#. translators: 1: product name of the order line, 2: what the merchant learned from the printshop.
#: src/Fulfilment/LineActions.php:664
#, php-format
msgid "Pixonaut: the printshop does not have the order for \"%1$s\". %2$s"
msgstr "Pixonaut: de drukkerij heeft de bestelling voor “%1$s” niet. %2$s"

#. translators: %s: product name of the order line.
#: src/Fulfilment/LineActions.php:686 src/Fulfilment/LineCancellation.php:375
#: src/Fulfilment/OrderCancelled.php:73
#, php-format
msgid "Pixonaut: the printshop order for \"%s\" was cancelled."
msgstr "Pixonaut: de drukopdracht voor “%s” is geannuleerd."

#. translators: Reason in an order note when a merchant rehearses a failed printshop order in the Pixonaut sandbox.
#: src/Fulfilment/LineActions.php:706
msgid "Rehearsed in the Pixonaut sandbox."
msgstr "Gesimuleerd in de Pixonaut-sandbox."

#. translators: 1: product name of the order line, 2: why Pixonaut refused, a full sentence or two.
#: src/Fulfilment/LineActions.php:741
#, php-format
msgid "Pixonaut: \"%1$s\" was not sent to the printshop again. %2$s"
msgstr "Pixonaut: “%1$s” is niet opnieuw naar de drukkerij gestuurd. %2$s"

#. translators: %s: product name of the order line.
#: src/Fulfilment/LineCancellation.php:169
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: \"%s\" is not cancelled yet: the store could not schedule it. It "
"is not sent to the printshop meanwhile. Update the order to try again."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: “%s” is nog niet geannuleerd: de winkel kon het niet inplannen. "
"Het wordt intussen niet naar de drukkerij gestuurd. Werk de bestelling bij "
"om het opnieuw te proberen."

#. translators: 1: product name of the order line, 2: the error code Pixonaut answered.
#: src/Fulfilment/LineCancellation.php:265
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: a design of \"%1$s\" could not be rejected in Pixonaut, which "
"answered \"%2$s\". It stays unapproved there, so it is not printed."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: een ontwerp van “%1$s” kon niet worden afgewezen in Pixonaut, dat "
"“%2$s” antwoordde. Het blijft daar niet goedgekeurd, dus het wordt niet "
"gedrukt."

#. translators: %s: product name of the order line.
#: src/Fulfilment/LineCancellation.php:274
#, php-format
msgid "Pixonaut: \"%s\" was cancelled before it was sent to the printshop."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: “%s” is geannuleerd voordat het naar de drukkerij werd gestuurd."

#. translators: %s: product name of the order line.
#: src/Fulfilment/LineCancellation.php:294
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: \"%s\" may have a printshop order, which was not cancelled: the "
"store is not connected to the Pixonaut workspace it was ordered under. Check "
"the order in Pixonaut."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: “%s” heeft mogelijk een drukopdracht, die niet is geannuleerd: de "
"winkel is niet gekoppeld aan de Pixonaut-werkruimte waaronder het is "
"besteld. Controleer de bestelling in Pixonaut."

#. translators: %s: product name of the order line.
#: src/Fulfilment/LineCancellation.php:361
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: the printshop order for \"%s\" was not cancelled: the store is not "
"connected to the Pixonaut workspace it was ordered under. Cancel it in "
"Pixonaut."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: de drukopdracht voor “%s” is niet geannuleerd: de winkel is niet "
"gekoppeld aan de Pixonaut-werkruimte waaronder het is besteld. Annuleer de "
"drukopdracht in Pixonaut."

#. translators: 1: product name of the order line, 2: why the printshop keeps the order.
#: src/Fulfilment/LineCancellation.php:392
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: the printshop order for \"%1$s\" was not cancelled: %2$s Ask the "
"printshop."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: de drukopdracht voor “%1$s” is niet geannuleerd: %2$s Neem contact "
"op met de drukkerij."

#. translators: %s: product name of the order line.
#: src/Fulfilment/LineCancellation.php:402
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: \"%s\" was cancelled. Its printshop order had failed, so there was "
"nothing to stop at the printshop."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: “%s” is geannuleerd. De drukopdracht was mislukt, dus er viel bij "
"de drukkerij niets te stoppen."

#. translators: 1: product name of the order line, 2: the error code Pixonaut answered, 3: Pixonaut's reason, if it gave one, with a leading space.
#: src/Fulfilment/LineCancellation.php:415
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: the printshop order for \"%1$s\" could not be cancelled: Pixonaut "
"answered \"%2$s\".%3$s Ask the printshop to stop it."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: de drukopdracht voor “%1$s” kon niet worden geannuleerd: Pixonaut "
"antwoordde “%2$s”.%3$s Vraag de drukkerij om de opdracht te stoppen."

#. translators: Why the printshop did not cancel an order, filling in %2$s of an order note. Ends a sentence; lower case.
#: src/Fulfilment/LineCancellation.php:531
msgid "the printshop has made it already."
msgstr "de drukkerij heeft het al gemaakt."

#. translators: Why the printshop did not cancel an order, filling in %2$s of an order note. Ends a sentence; lower case.
#: src/Fulfilment/LineCancellation.php:533
msgid "the printshop has begun it and did not cancel it."
msgstr "de drukkerij is er al mee begonnen en heeft het niet geannuleerd."

#. translators: Why the printshop did not cancel an order, filling in %2$s of an order note. Ends a sentence; lower case.
#: src/Fulfilment/LineCancellation.php:535
msgid "its printshop cannot stop orders through Pixonaut."
msgstr "de drukkerij kan geen bestellingen stoppen via Pixonaut."

#. translators: Why the printshop did not cancel an order, filling in %2$s of an order note. Ends a sentence; lower case.
#: src/Fulfilment/LineCancellation.php:537
msgid "its printshop is no longer connected to Pixonaut."
msgstr "de drukkerij is niet meer aan Pixonaut gekoppeld."

#. translators: Why the printshop did not cancel an order, filling in %2$s of an order note. Ends a sentence; lower case.
#: src/Fulfilment/LineCancellation.php:539
msgid "the printshop cancelled it, but it shipped meanwhile."
msgstr ""
"de drukkerij heeft het geannuleerd, maar het was intussen al verzonden."

#. translators: Why the printshop did not cancel an order, filling in %2$s of an order note. Ends a sentence; lower case.
#: src/Fulfilment/LineCancellation.php:541
msgid "the printshop has it."
msgstr "de drukkerij heeft het in behandeling."

#: src/Fulfilment/NeedsAttention.php:115
msgid ""
"Pixonaut refused the printshop the item was sent to: only the printshop of "
"the product's blank can make it. Check the blank in Pixonaut, then retry."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut weigerde de drukkerij waarnaar het artikel is gestuurd: alleen de "
"drukkerij van het blanco product waarop het product is gebaseerd, kan het "
"maken. Controleer het blanco product in Pixonaut en probeer het daarna "
"opnieuw."

#: src/Fulfilment/NeedsAttention.php:116
msgid ""
"The printshop that makes the item is disconnected in Pixonaut. Reconnect it "
"in Pixonaut, then retry."
msgstr ""
"De drukkerij die het artikel maakt, is in Pixonaut ontkoppeld. Koppel de "
"drukkerij opnieuw in Pixonaut en probeer het daarna opnieuw."

#: src/Fulfilment/NeedsAttention.php:117
msgid ""
"Pixonaut has no printshop to make the item: its design is on no blank, and "
"the workspace has no default printshop. Set one in Pixonaut, then retry."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut heeft geen drukkerij om het artikel te maken: het ontwerp hoort bij "
"geen enkel blanco product en de werkruimte heeft geen standaarddrukkerij. "
"Stel er een in in Pixonaut en probeer het daarna opnieuw."

#: src/Fulfilment/NeedsAttention.php:118
msgid ""
"The blank variant the item was bought as is retired in Pixonaut, so the "
"printshop cannot make it. Refund or cancel the item."
msgstr ""
"De variant van het blanco product waarmee het artikel is gekocht, is in "
"Pixonaut niet meer leverbaar, dus de drukkerij kan het niet maken. Betaal "
"het artikel terug of annuleer het."

#: src/Fulfilment/NeedsAttention.php:120
msgid ""
"Pixonaut could not tell which variant of the blank the item is: the product "
"sells no variant of its blank. Pick its variant on the product, then refund "
"or cancel the item."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut kon niet bepalen welke variant van het blanco product het artikel "
"is: het product verkoopt geen enkele variant van het blanco product. Kies de "
"variant bij het product en betaal het artikel daarna terug of annuleer het."

#: src/Fulfilment/NeedsAttention.php:122
msgid ""
"The item's print is at a size its position on the blank does not print, or "
"larger than the printshop's machine takes. Check the blank's positions and "
"the printshop's machine in Pixonaut, then have the customer personalise the "
"item again at a size it prints."
msgstr ""
"De druk van het artikel heeft een formaat dat de drukpositie op het blanco "
"product niet drukt, of dat groter is dan de machine van de drukkerij aankan. "
"Controleer de drukposities van het blanco product en de machine van de "
"drukkerij in Pixonaut, en laat de klant het artikel daarna opnieuw "
"personaliseren in een formaat dat wel gedrukt kan worden."

#: src/Fulfilment/NeedsAttention.php:123
msgid ""
"The printshop's embroidery machine cannot stitch the item's design as it is, "
"for example a photo or a picture of too many colours. Check the design in "
"Pixonaut, then have the customer personalise the item again."
msgstr ""
"De borduurmachine van de drukkerij kan het ontwerp van het artikel niet "
"borduren zoals het is, bijvoorbeeld een foto of een afbeelding met te veel "
"kleuren. Controleer het ontwerp in Pixonaut en laat de klant het artikel "
"daarna opnieuw personaliseren."

#: src/Fulfilment/NeedsAttention.php:124
msgid ""
"The printshop's embroidery machine could not read the item's design. Check "
"the design in Pixonaut, then retry."
msgstr ""
"De borduurmachine van de drukkerij kon het ontwerp van het artikel niet "
"lezen. Controleer het ontwerp in Pixonaut en probeer het daarna opnieuw."

#: src/Fulfilment/NeedsAttention.php:125
msgid ""
"The printshop charges a fee to set up the embroidery, and the fee has not "
"been accepted in Pixonaut. Accept it for the printshop in Pixonaut, then "
"retry."
msgstr ""
"De drukkerij rekent kosten voor het instellen van het borduurwerk, en die "
"kosten zijn in Pixonaut nog niet geaccepteerd. Accepteer ze voor de "
"drukkerij in Pixonaut en probeer het daarna opnieuw."

#: src/Fulfilment/NeedsAttention.php:126
msgid ""
"The printshop needs a value the blank's variant or placement does not have. "
"Fill it in for the blank in Pixonaut, then retry."
msgstr ""
"De drukkerij heeft een waarde nodig die de variant of de drukpositie van het "
"blanco product niet heeft. Vul die in Pixonaut in bij het blanco product en "
"probeer het daarna opnieuw."

#: src/Fulfilment/NeedsAttention.php:127
msgid ""
"The design already has a printshop order in Pixonaut that this item did not "
"place, for example one placed in the studio. Check that order; if the item "
"is to be made as well, choose Order again anyway."
msgstr ""
"Het ontwerp heeft in Pixonaut al een drukopdracht die niet door dit artikel "
"is geplaatst, bijvoorbeeld een die in de studio is geplaatst. Controleer die "
"opdracht; als het artikel ook gemaakt moet worden, kies dan Toch opnieuw "
"bestellen."

#: src/Fulfilment/NeedsAttention.php:128
msgid ""
"The design's personal data was erased in Pixonaut, so it can no longer be "
"printed."
msgstr ""
"De persoonsgegevens van het ontwerp zijn in Pixonaut gewist, dus het kan "
"niet meer worden gedrukt."

#: src/Fulfilment/NeedsAttention.php:130
msgid "The design changed in Pixonaut since the customer approved it."
msgstr ""
"Het ontwerp is in Pixonaut gewijzigd sinds de klant het heeft goedgekeurd."

#: src/Fulfilment/NeedsAttention.php:131
msgid ""
"The design was deleted in Pixonaut, so it can no longer be printed. Check "
"the order with the customer."
msgstr ""
"Het ontwerp is in Pixonaut verwijderd, dus het kan niet meer worden gedrukt. "
"Overleg over de bestelling met de klant."

#: src/Fulfilment/NeedsAttention.php:132
msgid ""
"The design was changed in Pixonaut after it was approved, so it was not sent "
"to the printshop. Check the design before it is printed."
msgstr ""
"Het ontwerp is in Pixonaut gewijzigd nadat het was goedgekeurd, dus het is "
"niet naar de drukkerij gestuurd. Controleer het ontwerp voordat het wordt "
"gedrukt."

#: src/Fulfilment/NeedsAttention.php:133
msgid "Pixonaut no longer accepts the store's key. Reconnect the store."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut accepteert de sleutel van de winkel niet meer. Koppel de winkel "
"opnieuw."

#: src/Fulfilment/NeedsAttention.php:134
msgid ""
"The design was changed in Pixonaut after the customer bought it, so their "
"proof no longer shows it. Check the design with the customer."
msgstr ""
"Het ontwerp is in Pixonaut gewijzigd nadat de klant het had gekocht, dus de "
"drukproef van de klant toont het niet meer. Overleg over het ontwerp met de "
"klant."

#: src/Fulfilment/NeedsAttention.php:135
msgid ""
"The design was no longer waiting for the customer's approval when the order "
"was paid, for example because it was rejected in Pixonaut."
msgstr ""
"Het ontwerp wachtte niet meer op goedkeuring van de klant toen de bestelling "
"werd betaald, bijvoorbeeld omdat het in Pixonaut was afgewezen."

#: src/Fulfilment/NeedsAttention.php:136
msgid ""
"The customer did not approve the design by the deadline, so it was rejected "
"and will not be printed. Refund or cancel the item."
msgstr ""
"De klant heeft het ontwerp niet binnen de termijn goedgekeurd, dus het is "
"afgewezen en wordt niet gedrukt. Betaal het artikel terug of annuleer het."

#: src/Fulfilment/NeedsAttention.php:137
msgid ""
"The customer rejected the proof of the design, so it will not be printed. "
"Refund or cancel the item."
msgstr ""
"De klant heeft de drukproef van het ontwerp afgewezen, dus het wordt niet "
"gedrukt. Betaal het artikel terug of annuleer het."

#: src/Fulfilment/NeedsAttention.php:139
msgid "Pixonaut could not be reached, or kept failing. Retry the item."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut was niet bereikbaar of bleef fouten geven. Probeer het artikel "
"opnieuw."

#: src/Fulfilment/NeedsAttention.php:140
msgid "The printshop order failed. Retry it, or cancel the item."
msgstr ""
"De drukopdracht is mislukt. Probeer het opnieuw of annuleer het artikel."

#: src/Fulfilment/NeedsAttention.php:141
msgid ""
"Pixonaut cannot tell whether the printshop received the order. Check with "
"the printshop, then tell Pixonaut whether it has the order."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut kan niet zien of de drukkerij de bestelling heeft ontvangen. Vraag "
"het na bij de drukkerij en laat Pixonaut daarna weten of de drukkerij de "
"bestelling heeft."

#: src/Fulfilment/NeedsAttention.php:142
msgid "Check the order in Pixonaut."
msgstr "Controleer de bestelling in Pixonaut."

#. translators: %s: product name of the order line.
#: src/Fulfilment/NeedsAttention.php:154
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: the printshop order for \"%s\" was sent, but its answer was lost, "
"so Pixonaut cannot tell whether the printshop has it. Check with the "
"printshop, then settle it in the Pixonaut box of this order."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: de drukopdracht voor “%s” is verstuurd, maar het antwoord is "
"verloren gegaan, dus Pixonaut kan niet zien of de drukkerij de opdracht "
"heeft. Vraag het na bij de drukkerij en handel het daarna af in het Pixonaut-"
"vak van deze bestelling."

#. translators: %s: product name of the order line.
#: src/Fulfilment/OrderDeliveryChanged.php:121
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: the delivery address of the printshop order for \"%s\" was changed "
"in Pixonaut. The address of this order was not changed."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: het verzendadres van de drukopdracht voor “%s” is gewijzigd in "
"Pixonaut. Het adres van deze bestelling is niet gewijzigd."

#. translators: 1: product name of the order line, 2: the reason Pixonaut gave.
#: src/Fulfilment/OrderFailed.php:81
#, php-format
msgid "Pixonaut: the printshop order for \"%1$s\" failed: %2$s"
msgstr "Pixonaut: de drukopdracht voor “%1$s” is mislukt: %2$s"

#: src/Fulfilment/OrderHold.php:138
msgid ""
"Pixonaut has taken the order and holds it. It has not been sent to the "
"printshop yet."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut heeft de bestelling aangenomen en houdt die vast. De bestelling is "
"nog niet naar de drukkerij gestuurd."

#: src/Fulfilment/OrderHold.php:153
msgid "It has not been sent to the printshop yet."
msgstr "De opdracht is nog niet naar de drukkerij gestuurd."

#. translators: 1: product name of the order line, 2: why it is held and when it goes ahead.
#: src/Fulfilment/OrderHold.php:155
#, php-format
msgid "Pixonaut: the printshop order for \"%1$s\" is held. %2$s"
msgstr "Pixonaut: de drukopdracht voor “%1$s” wordt vastgehouden. %2$s"

#. translators: %s: product name of the order line.
#: src/Fulfilment/OrderHold.php:170
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: the printshop order for \"%s\" was released because the Pixonaut "
"workspace upgraded its plan."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: de drukopdracht voor “%s” is vrijgegeven omdat de Pixonaut-"
"werkruimte het abonnement heeft geüpgraded."

#. translators: %s: product name of the order line.
#: src/Fulfilment/OrderHold.php:172
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: the printshop order for \"%s\" was released because a new month "
"began on the free plan."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: de drukopdracht voor “%s” is vrijgegeven omdat er een nieuwe maand "
"is begonnen op het gratis abonnement."

#. translators: %s: product name of the order line.
#: src/Fulfilment/OrderHold.php:174
#, php-format
msgid "Pixonaut: the printshop order for \"%s\" was released."
msgstr "Pixonaut: de drukopdracht voor “%s” is vrijgegeven."

#. translators: %s: product name of the order line.
#: src/Fulfilment/OrderHold.php:179
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: the printshop order for \"%s\" was released because the Pixonaut "
"workspace upgraded its plan, and goes on to the printshop."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: de drukopdracht voor “%s” is vrijgegeven omdat de Pixonaut-"
"werkruimte het abonnement heeft geüpgraded, en gaat door naar de drukkerij."

#. translators: %s: product name of the order line.
#: src/Fulfilment/OrderHold.php:181
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: the printshop order for \"%s\" was released because a new month "
"began on the free plan, and goes on to the printshop."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: de drukopdracht voor “%s” is vrijgegeven omdat er een nieuwe maand "
"is begonnen op het gratis abonnement, en gaat door naar de drukkerij."

#. translators: %s: product name of the order line.
#: src/Fulfilment/OrderHold.php:183
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: the printshop order for \"%s\" was released, and goes on to the "
"printshop."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: de drukopdracht voor “%s” is vrijgegeven en gaat door naar de "
"drukkerij."

#: src/Fulfilment/OrderHold.php:194
msgid "The Pixonaut workspace has used its free plan's orders for this month."
msgstr ""
"De Pixonaut-werkruimte heeft de bestellingen van het gratis abonnement voor "
"deze maand opgebruikt."

#. translators: %d: the free plan's orders a month.
#: src/Fulfilment/OrderHold.php:197
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The Pixonaut workspace has used its free plan's %d order for this month."
msgid_plural ""
"The Pixonaut workspace has used its free plan's %d orders for this month."
msgstr[0] ""
"De Pixonaut-werkruimte heeft de %d bestelling van het gratis abonnement voor "
"deze maand opgebruikt."
msgstr[1] ""
"De Pixonaut-werkruimte heeft de %d bestellingen van het gratis abonnement "
"voor deze maand opgebruikt."

#: src/Fulfilment/OrderHold.php:201
msgid ""
"It goes to the printshop when the workspace upgrades, or when the month "
"resets if the new month has room for it."
msgstr ""
"De opdracht gaat naar de drukkerij wanneer de werkruimte upgradet, of "
"wanneer de maand opnieuw begint als er in de nieuwe maand ruimte voor is."

#. translators: %s: the date the month resets.
#: src/Fulfilment/OrderHold.php:204
#, php-format
msgid ""
"It goes to the printshop when the workspace upgrades, or when the month "
"resets on %s if the new month has room for it."
msgstr ""
"De opdracht gaat naar de drukkerij wanneer de werkruimte upgradet, of "
"wanneer de maand op %s opnieuw begint als er in de nieuwe maand ruimte voor "
"is."

#. translators: 1: product name, 2: status Pixonaut reported
#: src/Fulfilment/OrderStatusChanged.php:194
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut reported the status \"%2$s\" for \"%1$s\", which this plugin "
"version does not know; nothing was changed."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut meldde de status “%2$s” voor “%1$s”, die deze versie van de plugin "
"niet kent; er is niets gewijzigd."

#. translators: %s: product name
#: src/Fulfilment/OrderStatusChanged.php:302
#, php-format
msgid "Pixonaut: \"%s\" was printed at the printshop."
msgstr "Pixonaut: “%s” is gedrukt bij de drukkerij."

#. translators: %s: product name
#: src/Fulfilment/OrderStatusChanged.php:332
#, php-format
msgid "Pixonaut: \"%s\" was shipped."
msgstr "Pixonaut: “%s” is verzonden."

#. translators: 1: product name, 2: carrier, tracking number and link
#: src/Fulfilment/OrderStatusChanged.php:335
#, php-format
msgid "Pixonaut: \"%1$s\" was shipped. Tracking: %2$s"
msgstr "Pixonaut: “%1$s” is verzonden. Zending volgen: %2$s"

#. translators: 1: product name, 2: carrier, tracking number and link. Order note the merchant reads.
#: src/Fulfilment/OrderTrackingChanged.php:144
#, php-format
msgid "Pixonaut: tracking was added for \"%1$s\": %2$s"
msgstr "Pixonaut: volgnummer toegevoegd voor “%1$s”: %2$s"

#. translators: 1: product name, 2: new carrier, tracking number and link, 3: the carrier and tracking number before. Order note the merchant reads.
#: src/Fulfilment/OrderTrackingChanged.php:146
#, php-format
msgid "Pixonaut: the tracking of \"%1$s\" was corrected to %2$s. It was %3$s."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: het volgnummer van “%1$s” is gecorrigeerd naar %2$s. Voorheen: "
"%3$s."

#. translators: %s: the error code Pixonaut answered, e.g. order_at_printshop.
#: src/Fulfilment/RetryRefusal.php:30
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut refused to place the order again with \"%s\". Nothing was changed."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut weigerde de bestelling opnieuw te plaatsen met “%s”. Er is niets "
"gewijzigd."

#: src/Fulfilment/RetryRefusal.php:42
msgid "The print is still being made. Try again once it is finished."
msgstr "De druk wordt nog gemaakt. Probeer het opnieuw zodra die klaar is."

#: src/Fulfilment/RetryRefusal.php:43
msgid ""
"The printshop order is no longer failed in Pixonaut, so it was not placed "
"again."
msgstr ""
"De drukopdracht staat in Pixonaut niet meer als mislukt, dus die is niet "
"opnieuw geplaatst."

#: src/Fulfilment/RetryRefusal.php:44
msgid "The printshop has the order already, so it is not placed again."
msgstr ""
"De drukkerij heeft de opdracht al, dus die wordt niet opnieuw geplaatst."

#: src/Fulfilment/RetryRefusal.php:45
msgid "The order was placed again already, by an earlier retry."
msgstr "De bestelling is al opnieuw geplaatst, bij een eerdere poging."

#: src/Fulfilment/RetryRefusal.php:46
msgid ""
"The design changed in Pixonaut since its print was made, so the print is no "
"longer the design's. Check the design in Pixonaut."
msgstr ""
"Het ontwerp is in Pixonaut gewijzigd sinds de druk is gemaakt, dus de druk "
"hoort niet meer bij het ontwerp. Controleer het ontwerp in Pixonaut."

#: src/Fulfilment/RetryRefusal.php:47
msgid ""
"The print's files were deleted in Pixonaut, so it cannot be sent to the "
"printshop again."
msgstr ""
"De bestanden van de druk zijn in Pixonaut verwijderd, dus die kan niet "
"opnieuw naar de drukkerij worden gestuurd."

#: src/Fulfilment/RetryRefusal.php:48
msgid ""
"The design has another printshop order in Pixonaut that this item did not "
"place, for example one placed in the studio. Check that order in Pixonaut, "
"and cancel it there or settle the item with the customer."
msgstr ""
"Het ontwerp heeft in Pixonaut een andere drukopdracht die niet door dit "
"artikel is geplaatst, bijvoorbeeld een die in de studio is geplaatst. "
"Controleer die opdracht in Pixonaut en annuleer die daar, of handel het "
"artikel af met de klant."

#: src/Fulfilment/RetryRefusal.php:49
msgid "The printshop is paused in Pixonaut. Resume it in Pixonaut, then retry."
msgstr ""
"De drukkerij is gepauzeerd in Pixonaut. Hervat de drukkerij in Pixonaut en "
"probeer het daarna opnieuw."

#: src/Fulfilment/RetryRefusal.php:53
msgid ""
"Pixonaut was busy with the order and changed nothing. Try again in a moment."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut was bezig met de bestelling en heeft niets gewijzigd. Probeer het "
"zo meteen opnieuw."

#: src/Fulfilment/RetryRefusal.php:56
msgid ""
"Pixonaut no longer has the printshop order or its print. Check the order in "
"Pixonaut."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut heeft de drukopdracht of de druk ervan niet meer. Controleer de "
"bestelling in Pixonaut."

#: src/Fulfilment/RetryRefusal.php:58
msgid ""
"Pixonaut did not accept the request the store sent. Check the Pixonaut log "
"under WooCommerce > Status > Logs."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut accepteerde het verzoek van de winkel niet. Controleer het Pixonaut-"
"log onder WooCommerce > Status > Logs."

#: src/Fulfilment/RetryRefusal.php:60
msgid ""
"The store's key may not place orders again in Pixonaut. Check the key in "
"Pixonaut, or reconnect the store."
msgstr ""
"De sleutel van de winkel mag in Pixonaut geen bestellingen opnieuw plaatsen. "
"Controleer de sleutel in Pixonaut of koppel de winkel opnieuw."

#: src/Fulfilment/RetryRefusal.php:61
msgid "Printshop orders are turned off for the workspace in Pixonaut."
msgstr "Drukopdrachten zijn in Pixonaut uitgeschakeld voor de werkruimte."

#: src/Fulfilment/RetryRefusal.php:62
msgid ""
"The Pixonaut workspace is suspended. Check its billing in Pixonaut, then "
"retry."
msgstr ""
"De Pixonaut-werkruimte is opgeschort. Controleer de facturering in Pixonaut "
"en probeer het daarna opnieuw."

#: src/Fulfilment/RetryRefusal.php:63
msgid ""
"The workspace's plan in Pixonaut allows no more of this. Check the plan in "
"Pixonaut, then retry."
msgstr ""
"Het abonnement van de werkruimte in Pixonaut heeft zijn limiet bereikt. "
"Controleer het abonnement in Pixonaut en probeer het daarna opnieuw."

#: src/Fulfilment/RetryRefusal.php:65
msgid ""
"The printshop the order went to is no longer available in Pixonaut. Check "
"the printshop in Pixonaut, then retry."
msgstr ""
"De drukkerij waar de bestelling naartoe ging, is niet meer beschikbaar in "
"Pixonaut. Controleer de drukkerij in Pixonaut en probeer het daarna opnieuw."

#: src/Fulfilment/RetryRefusal.php:72
msgid ""
"The printshop cannot print the item as it is: it does not offer the print's "
"method or colour output, or the print file is too large for it. Check the "
"printshop and the blank in Pixonaut, then retry."
msgstr ""
"De drukkerij kan het artikel niet drukken zoals het is: ze biedt de "
"druktechniek of kleuruitvoer van de druk niet aan, of het drukbestand is te "
"groot voor haar. Controleer de drukkerij en het blanco product in Pixonaut "
"en probeer het daarna opnieuw."

#: src/Fulfilment/RetryRefusal.php:81
msgid ""
"The item's prints do not fit the blank's placements in Pixonaut: a placement "
"the blank must print is empty, or prints share or miss one. Check the "
"blank's placements in Pixonaut, then retry."
msgstr ""
"De drukken van het artikel passen in Pixonaut niet bij de drukposities van "
"het blanco product: een drukpositie die op het blanco product bedrukt moet "
"worden, is leeg, of drukken delen een drukpositie of slaan er een over. "
"Controleer de drukposities van het blanco product in Pixonaut en probeer het "
"daarna opnieuw."

#: src/Fulfilment/RetryRefusal.php:86
msgid ""
"Pixonaut refused moving the order to another blank. Place it again as it is, "
"or move it in Pixonaut."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut weigerde de bestelling naar een ander blanco product te "
"verplaatsen. Plaats de bestelling opnieuw zoals ze is, of verplaats ze in "
"Pixonaut."

#: src/Fulfilment/RetryRefusal.php:87
msgid ""
"The delivery address lacks the postcode the printshop needs. Add it to the "
"order's shipping address, then retry."
msgstr ""
"In het verzendadres ontbreekt de postcode die de drukkerij nodig heeft. Vul "
"die in bij het verzendadres van de bestelling en probeer het daarna opnieuw."

#: src/Fulfilment/RetryRefusal.php:88
msgid ""
"The saved address the order ships to is gone in Pixonaut. Check the order's "
"shipping address, then retry."
msgstr ""
"Het opgeslagen adres waar de bestelling naartoe wordt verzonden, bestaat "
"niet meer in Pixonaut. Controleer het verzendadres van de bestelling en "
"probeer het daarna opnieuw."

#: src/Fulfilment/Shipments.php:89
msgid "Pixonaut: every item has shipped."
msgstr "Pixonaut: alle artikelen zijn verzonden."

#: src/Fulfilment/Shipments.php:105
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: All personalised items shipped. The order's other items are yours "
"to ship."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: alle gepersonaliseerde artikelen zijn verzonden. De overige "
"artikelen van de bestelling moet u zelf verzenden."

#. translators: Option of a product's Group numbers setting: the designer's form numbers its groups. Admin product page.
#: src/GroupNumbers.php:47
msgctxt "group numbers"
msgid "On"
msgstr "Aan"

#. translators: Option of a product's Group numbers setting: the designer's form shows its groups' names with no numbers. Admin product page.
#: src/GroupNumbers.php:49
msgctxt "group numbers"
msgid "Off"
msgstr "Uit"

#: src/Labels.php:317
msgid "Personalisation is unavailable right now. Please try again later."
msgstr ""
"Personaliseren is op dit moment niet beschikbaar. Probeer het later opnieuw."

#: src/Labels.php:321
msgid "Please personalise this product before adding it to your cart."
msgstr "Personaliseer dit product voordat u het aan uw winkelwagen toevoegt."

#: src/Labels.php:325
msgid "We could not save your design. Please try again."
msgstr "We konden uw ontwerp niet opslaan. Probeer het opnieuw."

#: src/Labels.php:329
msgid "Your design does not match this product. Please personalise it again."
msgstr "Uw ontwerp past niet bij dit product. Personaliseer het opnieuw."

#: src/Labels.php:333
msgid "This product was just updated, please reload."
msgstr "Dit product is zojuist bijgewerkt. Laad de pagina opnieuw."

#: src/Labels.php:337
msgid "Your design preview expired. Please approve it again."
msgstr "Het voorbeeld van uw ontwerp is verlopen. Keur het opnieuw goed."

#: src/Labels.php:341
msgid ""
"This design is already in a cart or an order. Please personalise the product "
"again."
msgstr ""
"Dit ontwerp zit al in een winkelwagen of een bestelling. Personaliseer het "
"product opnieuw."

#: src/Labels.php:345
msgid "Your design could not be prepared. Please check it and try again."
msgstr ""
"Uw ontwerp kon niet worden voorbereid. Controleer het en probeer het opnieuw."

#. translators: %s: the name of the personalised product in the shopper's cart.
#: src/Labels.php:350
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The design for \"%s\" is no longer available. Please remove it from your "
"cart, or personalise it again."
msgstr ""
"Het ontwerp voor \"%s\" is niet meer beschikbaar. Verwijder het product uit "
"uw winkelwagen of personaliseer het opnieuw."

#. translators: %s: the names of the product options the shopper has not chosen yet, as a list such as "Colour and Size". Notice on the product page after pressing the Personalise button.
#: src/Labels.php:355
#, php-format
msgid "Please choose a value for %s before personalising this product."
msgstr "Kies een waarde voor %s voordat u dit product personaliseert."

#. translators: %s: the labels of the design's fields the shopper must change, as a list such as "Photo, Name and Class".
#: src/Labels.php:360
#, php-format
msgid "Please change these fields: %s"
msgstr "Wijzig deze velden: %s"

#. translators: Label of the checkbox next to the preview on the product page, shown to the shopper; ticking it approves the design. %1$s and %2$s go around the word for the preview, which becomes a link that opens the design's proof.
#: src/Labels.php:365
#, php-format
msgid "I approve the %1$spreview%2$s"
msgstr "Ik keur het %1$svoorbeeld%2$s goed"

#. translators: Button in the cart and on the order received page, shown to the shopper; opens the proof of the design.
#: src/Labels.php:370
msgid "Open proof"
msgstr "Drukproef openen"

#: src/Labels.php:374
msgid ""
"Please tick \"I approve the preview\" before adding this product to your "
"cart."
msgstr ""
"Vink “Ik keur het voorbeeld goed” aan voordat u dit product aan uw "
"winkelwagen toevoegt."

#. translators: Short note under the live preview on the product page, shown to the shopper.
#: src/Labels.php:379
msgid "The preview updates as you type"
msgstr "Het voorbeeld wordt bijgewerkt terwijl u typt"

#: src/Labels.php:383
msgid "Loading the designer"
msgstr "Ontwerptool wordt geladen"

#. translators: Alternative text of the design preview image in the cart and order, shown to the shopper.
#: src/Labels.php:388
msgid "Your design"
msgstr "Uw ontwerp"

#. translators: Shown to the shopper in the window over the product page while their design's proof is made.
#: src/Labels.php:393
msgid "Preparing your proof"
msgstr "Uw drukproef wordt gemaakt"

#. translators: Button that closes the window showing the design's proof on the product page; here Close is a verb.
#: src/Labels.php:398
msgctxt "proof window"
msgid "Close"
msgstr "Sluiten"

#. translators: Heading above a cart or order item's design details, shown to the shopper.
#: src/Labels.php:403
msgid "Personalisation"
msgstr "Personalisatie"

#. translators: Shown to the shopper in place of a design's field values once the shop has removed them after its retention period.
#: src/Labels.php:408
msgid "Removed after the shop's retention period"
msgstr "Verwijderd na de bewaartermijn van de winkel"

#. translators: Name of a design field type, a free-text field, shown to the shopper in the cart line details.
#: src/Labels.php:413
msgid "Text"
msgstr "Tekst"

#. translators: Name of a design field type, a pick from a list of options, shown to the shopper in the cart line details.
#: src/Labels.php:418
msgid "Choice"
msgstr "Keuze"

#. translators: Name of a design field type, a numeric value, shown to the shopper in the cart line details.
#: src/Labels.php:423
msgid "Number"
msgstr "Getal"

#. translators: Name of a design field type, a picked colour, shown to the shopper in the cart line details.
#: src/Labels.php:428
msgid "Colour"
msgstr "Kleur"

#. translators: Name of a design field type, an uploaded image, shown to the shopper in the cart line details.
#: src/Labels.php:433
msgid "Image"
msgstr "Afbeelding"

#. translators: Heading of the status of an order line on the admin order screen.
#: src/Labels.php:438
msgctxt "heading: status of an order line"
msgid "Status"
msgstr "Status"

#. translators: Heading of the shipment tracking links in the order details and shipping emails, shown to the shopper.
#: src/Labels.php:443
msgid "Tracking"
msgstr "Zending volgen"

#: src/Labels.php:447
msgid "Part of your order is on its way. The rest follows as soon as it ships."
msgstr ""
"Een deel van uw bestelling is onderweg. De rest volgt zodra die is verzonden."

#: src/Labels.php:451
msgid ""
"There is new tracking for your order. Follow your parcel with the details "
"below."
msgstr ""
"Er is een nieuw volgnummer voor uw bestelling. Volg uw pakket met de "
"gegevens hieronder."

#. translators: Accessible name of the tabs that switch between a product's sides, such as front and back, on the product page, read by screen readers.
#. translators: Heading of a group of fields in the Pixonaut tab of the product edit page, shown to the merchant: the product's sides, such as front and back, each with its template.
#: src/Labels.php:456 templates/admin/product-fields.php:152
msgid "Sides"
msgstr "Zijden"

#: src/Labels.php:460
msgid ""
"Your order is paid. Before we print it, please check the proof of your "
"design and approve it. Nothing is printed until you do."
msgstr ""
"Uw bestelling is betaald. Controleer de drukproef van uw ontwerp en keur die "
"goed voordat we gaan drukken. Er wordt niets gedrukt totdat u dat heeft "
"gedaan."

#. translators: Link in the proof email to the shopper, and under the order item on the order received page and in My Account; opens the proof page where the design is approved.
#: src/Labels.php:465
msgid "Review and approve your design"
msgstr "Bekijk uw ontwerp en keur het goed"

#: src/Labels.php:469
msgid "Thank you for approving your design. It is now on its way to print."
msgstr ""
"Bedankt voor het goedkeuren van uw ontwerp. Het gaat nu naar de drukkerij."

#: src/Labels.php:473
msgid ""
"We are still waiting for your approval. Please check the proof of your "
"design and approve it, or tell us what to change. Nothing is printed until "
"you do."
msgstr ""
"We wachten nog op uw goedkeuring. Controleer de drukproef van uw ontwerp en "
"keur die goed, of laat ons weten wat er moet veranderen. Er wordt niets "
"gedrukt totdat u dat heeft gedaan."

#. translators: %s: date of the approval deadline.
#: src/Labels.php:478
#, php-format
msgid ""
"If we have not heard from you by %s, we will print your design as the proof "
"shows it."
msgstr ""
"Als we op %s nog niets van u hebben gehoord, drukken we uw ontwerp zoals de "
"drukproef het toont."

#. translators: %s: date of the approval deadline.
#: src/Labels.php:483
#, php-format
msgid "If we have not heard from you by %s, we will cancel this item."
msgstr "Als we op %s nog niets van u hebben gehoord, annuleren we dit artikel."

#. translators: %s: date of the approval deadline.
#: src/Labels.php:488
#, php-format
msgid ""
"If we have not heard from you by %s, we will cancel this item and refund it."
msgstr ""
"Als we op %s nog niets van u hebben gehoord, annuleren we dit artikel en "
"betalen we het terug."

#. translators: %s: date of the approval deadline.
#: src/Labels.php:493
#, php-format
msgid ""
"If we have not heard from you by %s, we will not print your design and will "
"be in touch about this item."
msgstr ""
"Als we op %s nog niets van u hebben gehoord, drukken we uw ontwerp niet en "
"nemen we contact met u op over dit artikel."

#: src/Labels.php:497
msgid ""
"You did not approve your design by the deadline, so we have cancelled this "
"item. Nothing was printed."
msgstr ""
"U heeft uw ontwerp niet binnen de termijn goedgekeurd, dus we hebben dit "
"artikel geannuleerd. Er is niets gedrukt."

#: src/Labels.php:501
msgid "Its price is being refunded to you."
msgstr "Het bedrag wordt aan u terugbetaald."

#. translators: Button on the product page opened to edit a cart item, shown to the shopper; saves the changed design.
#: src/Labels.php:506
msgid "Update design"
msgstr "Ontwerp bijwerken"

#: src/Labels.php:510
msgid "This design was changed elsewhere. Please reload the page."
msgstr "Dit ontwerp is ergens anders gewijzigd. Laad de pagina opnieuw."

#: src/Labels.php:514
msgid "This design can no longer be changed."
msgstr "Dit ontwerp kan niet meer worden gewijzigd."

#: src/Labels.php:518
msgid "This item is no longer in your cart."
msgstr "Dit artikel zit niet meer in uw winkelwagen."

#. translators: Button on the product page, shown to the shopper; opens the Pixonaut designer to personalise the product.
#: src/Labels.php:523
msgctxt "verb: button that opens the designer"
msgid "Personalise"
msgstr "Personaliseren"

#: src/Labels.php:527
msgid ""
"We could not match your design to this visit. Please personalise the product "
"again."
msgstr ""
"We konden uw ontwerp niet aan dit bezoek koppelen. Personaliseer het product "
"opnieuw."

#: src/Labels.php:531
msgid "Your design is ready. Use it with the button below."
msgstr "Uw ontwerp is klaar. Gebruik het met de knop hieronder."

#. translators: Button on the product page, shown to the shopper after returning from the Pixonaut designer when their design could not be kept yet, or when they came back in a browser that did not open the designer; keeps the design.
#: src/Labels.php:536
msgid "Use my design"
msgstr "Mijn ontwerp gebruiken"

#. translators: Soft note above the add-to-cart row on a product page showing the design the shopper made in the Pixonaut designer.
#: src/Labels.php:541
msgid "This is your design."
msgstr "Dit is uw ontwerp."

#. translators: Button beside the note that this is the shopper's design; reopens it in the Pixonaut designer.
#: src/Labels.php:546
msgctxt "personalised product button"
msgid "Change"
msgstr "Wijzigen"

#. translators: %s: the name of a printed side, such as Front. Button beside the note that this is the shopper's design; reopens that side's design in the Pixonaut designer.
#: src/Labels.php:551
#, php-format
msgid "Change %s"
msgstr "%s wijzigen"

#. translators: Start of the line on a product page saying the design it shows is already in the shopper's cart, followed by its size and quantity.
#: src/Labels.php:556
msgid "In your cart"
msgstr "In uw winkelwagen"

#. translators: Button on the product page of an item already in the shopper's cart; reopens its design in the Pixonaut designer.
#: src/Labels.php:561
msgctxt "item in the cart button"
msgid "Change design"
msgstr "Ontwerp wijzigen"

#. translators: The main button on the product page of an item already in the shopper's cart; goes to the cart.
#: src/Labels.php:566
msgctxt "item in the cart button"
msgid "View cart"
msgstr "Winkelwagen bekijken"

#. translators: Link on the product page of an item already in the shopper's cart; opens the plain product page, to start another design from scratch.
#: src/Labels.php:571
msgid "Make another with a new design"
msgstr "Nog een maken met een nieuw ontwerp"

#: src/Labels.php:575
msgid ""
"This proof has changed since this link was sent. Please use the link in our "
"latest email."
msgstr ""
"Deze drukproef is gewijzigd sinds deze link werd verstuurd. Gebruik de link "
"in onze laatste e-mail."

#: src/Labels.php:579
msgid "This design is approved and can no longer be changed."
msgstr "Dit ontwerp is goedgekeurd en kan niet meer worden gewijzigd."

#. translators: Button on the page opened from a proof email, shown to the shopper; saves the changes and approves the design.
#: src/Labels.php:584
msgid "Save and approve design"
msgstr "Ontwerp opslaan en goedkeuren"

#: src/Labels.php:588
msgid ""
"We received your request to change your design. If you did not finish your "
"changes, you can open the design again here. Nothing is printed until you "
"approve it."
msgstr ""
"We hebben uw verzoek om uw ontwerp te wijzigen ontvangen. Als u nog niet "
"klaar was met uw wijzigingen, kunt u het ontwerp hier opnieuw openen. Er "
"wordt niets gedrukt totdat u het goedkeurt."

#. translators: Button in the email to the shopper after a change request; reopens the design.
#: src/Labels.php:593
msgid "Edit your design"
msgstr "Uw ontwerp bewerken"

#: src/Labels.php:597
msgid ""
"We could not match your changes to this visit. Please change your design "
"again from its product page."
msgstr ""
"We konden uw wijzigingen niet aan dit bezoek koppelen. Wijzig uw ontwerp "
"opnieuw vanaf de productpagina."

#: src/Labels.php:601
msgid "Your design has been updated."
