#. translators: %s: product name of the order line.
#: src/Privacy/LineErasure.php:175
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: the customer's personal data in \"%s\" is not erased yet: the "
"store could not schedule it. Run the erasure again from Tools > Erase "
"Personal Data."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: de persoonsgegevens van de klant in “%s” zijn nog niet gewist: de "
"winkel kon het niet inplannen. Voer het wissen opnieuw uit via Tools > "
"Persoonsgegevens verwijderen."

#. translators: %s: product name of the order line.
#: src/Privacy/LineErasure.php:295
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: the customer's personal data in \"%s\" was erased in Pixonaut."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: de persoonsgegevens van de klant in “%s” zijn gewist in Pixonaut."

#. translators: 1: product name of the order line, 2: the error code Pixonaut answered.
#: src/Privacy/LineErasure.php:371
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: the customer's personal data in \"%1$s\" could not be erased in "
"Pixonaut, which answered \"%2$s\". Run the erasure again from Tools > Erase "
"Personal Data."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: de persoonsgegevens van de klant in “%1$s” konden niet worden "
"gewist in Pixonaut, dat “%2$s” antwoordde. Voer het wissen opnieuw uit via "
"Tools > Persoonsgegevens verwijderen."

#. translators: %s: product name of the order line.
#: src/Privacy/LineErasure.php:423
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut: the customer's personal data in \"%s\" was not erased: the store "
"is not connected to the Pixonaut workspace it was ordered under. Erase it in "
"Pixonaut."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut: de persoonsgegevens van de klant in “%s” zijn niet gewist: de "
"winkel is niet gekoppeld aan de Pixonaut-werkruimte waaronder het is "
"besteld. Wis ze in Pixonaut."

#. translators: Name of this eraser in WordPress Tools > Erase Personal Data, which the merchant reads.
