msgstr "Instellingen van de werkruimte"

#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:289
msgid ""
"Set in the Pixonaut studio, except the brand, which you choose here. They "
"shape the pages Pixonaut shows your customers, and the orders it places."
msgstr ""
"Ingesteld in de Pixonaut-studio, behalve het merk, dat u hier kiest. Ze "
"bepalen de pagina’s die Pixonaut aan uw klanten toont, en de bestellingen "
"die Pixonaut plaatst."

#. translators: Link to the Pixonaut studio, where the workspace settings are changed.
#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:290
msgid "Change them in the studio"
msgstr "Wijzig ze in de studio"

#. translators: Row heading on the connection card: the workspace brand the store's customer-facing Pixonaut pages are drawn in.
#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:295
msgid "Brand"
msgstr "Merk"

