msgstr "Standaardtaal"

#. translators: Row heading on the connection card: where the printshop ships orders.
#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:371
msgid "Delivery address"
msgstr "Verzendadres"

#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:376
msgid "Each order ships to its customer"
msgstr "Elke bestelling wordt naar de klant verzonden"

#. translators: %s: the name of a delivery address saved in Pixonaut, e.g. Warehouse. Shown on the connection card.
#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:378
#, php-format
msgid "Every order ships to %s instead of its customer"
msgstr "Elke bestelling wordt naar %s verzonden in plaats van naar de klant"

#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:388
msgid ""
"Pixonaut cannot reach this store at its address, so it sends the store no "
"webhooks. Order and design updates still arrive: the store reads them from "
"Pixonaut every 15 minutes."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut kan deze winkel niet bereiken op zijn adres en stuurt de winkel dus "
"geen webhooks. Updates van bestellingen en ontwerpen komen toch binnen: de "
"winkel leest ze elke 15 minuten uit Pixonaut."

#. translators: Label on the connection card, followed by the address Pixonaut sends webhooks to.
#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:391
msgid "Webhook address:"
msgstr "Webhook-adres:"

#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:396
msgid ""
"On a sandbox connection you can point it at a tunnel to a local shop: change "
"the address under Webhooks in the Pixonaut studio."
msgstr ""
"Bij een sandbox-koppeling kan het adres naar een tunnel naar een lokale "
"winkel wijzen: wijzig het onder Webhooks in de Pixonaut-studio."

#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:397
msgid "Developing locally with a tunnel"
msgstr "Lokaal ontwikkelen met een tunnel"

#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:404
msgid ""
"Pixonaut is not sending this store its events: its webhook endpoint is "
"switched off. Order and design updates do not reach the store until it is "
"switched on again under Webhooks in the Pixonaut studio."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut stuurt deze winkel geen events: het webhook-endpoint is "
"uitgeschakeld. Updates van bestellingen en ontwerpen bereiken de winkel pas "
"als het weer wordt ingeschakeld onder Webhooks in de Pixonaut-studio."

#. translators: Button on the connection card that starts connecting the store again; here Connect is a verb.
#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:409
msgid "Connect again"
msgstr "Opnieuw koppelen"

#. translators: Button on the connection card that disconnects the store from Pixonaut; here Disconnect is a verb.
#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:413
msgid "Disconnect"
msgstr "Ontkoppelen"

#. translators: Link on the connection card to the Pixonaut studio, Pixonaut's own web app.
#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:414
msgid "Open the Pixonaut studio"
msgstr "De Pixonaut-studio openen"

#. translators: Link on the connection card to the guide on connecting the store to Pixonaut.
#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:419
