msgstr "Zo werkt het koppelen"

#: templates/admin/developer-tools.php:35
msgid "Developer tools saved."
msgstr "Ontwikkelaarstools opgeslagen."

#: templates/admin/developer-tools.php:36
msgid "An address was not saved: use a full http:// or https:// address."
msgstr ""
"Een adres is niet opgeslagen: gebruik een volledig http://- of https://-"
"adres."

#: templates/admin/developer-tools.php:37
msgid "The event stream was pulled."
msgstr "De eventstroom is opgehaald."

#: templates/admin/developer-tools.php:38
msgid ""
"The event stream was not pulled: Pixonaut refused or could not be reached, "
"or the store is still setting its first cursor. WooCommerce > Status > Logs "
"says which."
msgstr ""
"De eventstroom is niet opgehaald: Pixonaut weigerde of was niet bereikbaar, "
"of de winkel stelt de eerste cursor nog in. WooCommerce > Status > Logs "
"vermeldt welke van de drie."

#: templates/admin/developer-tools.php:39
msgid ""
"Pixonaut was asked to send the store’s endpoint a test webhook. The "
"connection card shows whether it arrived."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut is gevraagd een test-webhook naar het endpoint van de winkel te "
"sturen. De koppelingskaart toont of die is aangekomen."

#: templates/admin/developer-tools.php:40
msgid "Every linked product is queued to be re-checked."
msgstr ""
"Elk gekoppeld product staat in de wachtrij om opnieuw te worden "
"gecontroleerd."

#: templates/admin/developer-tools.php:41
msgid ""
"The re-check could not be queued. Check Action Scheduler under WooCommerce > "
"Status > Scheduled Actions."
msgstr ""
"De nieuwe controle kon niet in de wachtrij worden gezet. Controleer Action "
"Scheduler onder WooCommerce > Status > Geplande acties."

#: templates/admin/developer-tools.php:42
msgid ""
"The cached catalogue was cleared, and the stored designer links are being "
"withdrawn."
msgstr ""
"De gecachte catalogus is gewist en de opgeslagen ontwerplinks worden "
"ingetrokken."

#: templates/admin/developer-tools.php:43
msgid "The store is not connected to Pixonaut, or the connection is paused."
msgstr ""
"De winkel is niet gekoppeld aan Pixonaut, of de koppeling is gepauzeerd."

#. translators: Heading of the developer tools section on the settings page, read by developers.
#: templates/admin/developer-tools.php:65
