msgstr "Ontwikkelaarstools"

#. translators: Heading of the developer tools section on the settings page, read by developers.
#: templates/admin/developer-tools.php:66
msgid ""
"For testing the store against a local or staging Pixonaut, and for debugging "
"it. Unlocking only shows this section: everything here is saved and checked "
"on the server."
msgstr ""
"Om de winkel te testen tegen een lokale of staging-Pixonaut, en om fouten op "
"te sporen. Ontgrendelen toont alleen deze sectie: alles hier wordt op de "
