"Ingesteld door de constante %s in wp-config.php, die voorrang heeft op dit "
"veld."

#. translators: Button in developer tools that restores a field's default value; here Reset is a verb.
#. translators: Link that puts an option whose layout was adjusted by hand back on the side's own layout. Admin product page.
#: templates/admin/developer-tools.php:91
#: templates/admin/developer-tools.php:115 templates/admin/product-side.php:227
msgid "Reset"
msgstr "Herstellen"

#: templates/admin/developer-tools.php:93
msgid "Only an administrator can change where the store sends its key."
msgstr ""
"Alleen een beheerder kan wijzigen waarheen de winkel de sleutel stuurt."

#. translators: %s: the address the store currently sends requests to, e.g. https://api.pixonaut.app. Shown to developers in developer tools.
#: templates/admin/developer-tools.php:99
#, php-format
